# Applies to projects directly inside LectureXX/.
# Reference: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/UnrealEngine.gitignore
/*/Binaries/
/*/Intermediate/
/*/Saved/
/*/DerivedDataCache/
/*/Builds/
/*/*.sln
/*/*.slnx
/*/*.vcxproj
/*/*.vcxproj.filters
/*/*.vcxproj.user
/*/*.xcodeproj/
/*/*.xcworkspace/
/*/*.VC.db
/*/*.VC.opendb
/*/Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Keep Content, Config, Source, Build, .uproject and .uplugin files.
# Keep plugin Binaries and third-party libraries: binary-only plugins need them.
# Keep *_BuiltData.uasset files so baked lighting remains reproducible.
# Export packaged games to Builds/, not Build/ (which can contain source settings).
